  "sourceTitle": "LAVE: Zero-shot VQA Evaluation on Docmatix with LLMs - Do We Still Need Fine-Tuning?",
  "sourceBodyHash": "a8a815b58ef1d5e14cfc7770313fa03456f40121083a9092d4356833b92e9e4f",
